# Ping-Pong Test Graph
# Minimal graph for testing InReach message flow

# 1. IMAP Ingestion
'imap.mailbox.org' -> HOST Listener(ImapListener)
'993' -> PORT Listener
'{{ USERNAME }}' -> USERNAME Listener
'{{ PASSWORD }}' -> PASSWORD Listener
'INBOX' -> MAILBOX Listener
'' -> START Listener

# 2. Authentication
Listener OUT -> IN Verifier(AuthVerifier)

# 3. PING/PONG Handler
Verifier OUT -> IN PongHandler(PongHandler)

# 4. Send Reply Back
PongHandler OUT -> IN InReachSender(InReachSender)

# 5. InReach Sender Configuration
'cloud@boat.example.com' -> REPLY_ADDRESS InReachSender
'5000' -> DELAY_MS InReachSender